        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight, Capture and Develop a Team of Monstra as you Explore Ancient Ruins and gather Hundreds of Collectables in... Monstra Cap!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Cities, Mountains, Caves, Ruins and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Hundreds of Monstra and Artifacts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Items and Gear to Aid your Monstra in Combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the Secrets behind the recent rise in Monstra Hostility!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your Monstra over time by assigning Level Up Points!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of Summoning and Fight Monstra with Monstra! When a Monstra takes enough damage it enters its Soul Form, then you can Capture it in a Monstra Capsule, expanding your Team of Monstra!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Monstra Cap is a Single Player, Monster Capture, Action-RPG-Collectathon with a strong Retro style design.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight, Capture and Develop a Team of Monstra as you Explore Ancient Ruins and gather Hundreds of Collectables in... Monstra Cap!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Cities, Mountains, Caves, Ruins and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Hundreds of Monstra and Artifacts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Items and Gear to Aid your Monstra in Combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the Secrets behind the recent rise in Monstra Hostility!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your Monstra over time by assigning Level Up Points!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of Summoning and Fight Monstra with Monstra! When a Monstra takes enough damage it enters its Soul Form, then you can Capture it in a Monstra Capsule, expanding your Team of Monstra!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Monstra Cap is a Single Player, Monster Capture, Action-RPG-Collectathon with a strong Retro style design.</i></p>",
